<Weblab2>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:29:23.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 22366,
  "properties": {
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Weekday Reminder App</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n    <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Remind-Meow! Weekday Helper</h1>\n    <main class=\"container\">\n      <section class=\"left\">\n        <img id=\"main-img\" src=\"main-image.png\" alt=\"Reminder illustration\" />\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"right\">\n        <div id=\"output\" class=\"output\" aria-live=\"polite\">Click a weekday to see your reminder.</div>\n        <div class=\"buttons\">\n          <button id=\"mon-btn\" type=\"button\">Monday</button>\n          <button id=\"tue-btn\" type=\"button\">Tuesday</button>\n          <button id=\"wed-btn\" type=\"button\">Wednesday</button>\n          <button id=\"thu-btn\" type=\"button\">Thursday</button>\n          <button id=\"fri-btn\" type=\"button\">Friday</button>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// SELECTORS and LISTENERS: connect user actions (clicks) to handlers for specific UI elements\ndocument.querySelector('#mon-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  // UI CHANGE: show a new message in the output box\n  document.querySelector('#output').textContent = 'Monday reminder: Bring your notebook and charge your laptop.';\n});\n\n// TODO: Attach an event listener to the Tuesday button\n\n  // TODO: update text for Tuesday\n\n// TODO: Attach an event listener to the Wednesday button\n\n  // TODO: update text for Wednesday\n\n// TODO: Attach an event listener to the Thursday button\n\n  // TODO: update text for Thursday\n\n// TODO: Attach an event listener to the Friday button\n\n  // TODO: update text for Friday\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nhtml, body { height: 100%; }\nbody { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7fb; color: #222; }\n\n.title { text-align: center; margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: 1.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n\n.container { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 24px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.left { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #ddd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; }\n#main-img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: contain; }\n\n.right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }\n.output { min-height: 120px; border: 2px dashed #9aa4b2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; background: #fff; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.4; }\n\n.buttons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; width: 240px; margin-inline: auto; }\n.buttons button { padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid #333; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; }\n.buttons button:hover { background: #f0f4ff; }\n.buttons button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }\n\n@media (max-width: 800px) {\n  .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .buttons { width: 100%; }\n}\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "requirements.md",
          "language": "md",
          "contents": "# UI Elements\n\n- **Image**: `main-img`\n- **Output text box**: `output`\n- **Buttons**:\n  - `mon-btn` (Monday)\n  - `tue-btn` (Tuesday)\n  - `wed-btn` (Wednesday)\n  - `thu-btn` (Thursday)\n  - `fri-btn` (Friday)\n\n## Behavior\n- **Click a button** updates `#output` with a hardcoded reminder.\n- **App load** shows a starter message in `#output`.\n- **No console errors** and repeated clicks are safe.\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
